OL,3,AAlbanian protests turn violent: What we
OL,4,Aknow
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters and anti-riot police have
OL,7,Fclashed in Albania's main cities in
OL,8,Fscenes not witnessed for decades.
OL,10,FGovernment buildings have been attacked
OL,11,Fand some private businesses, too.
OL,13,FSo what is happening?
OL,15,FAlbania's capital Tirana has seen
OL,16,Fmonths of protests from an
OL,17,Fanti-government "Flamingo" movement,
OL,18,Fbut what started on Tuesday this week
OL,19,Fwas on a different scale.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
